            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Chay Zenhouse",
            "review_text": "Cẩm Ly\nVinh Long, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nI learned about Zenhouse through a friend's introduction and had the opportunity to bring my family to enjoy delicious vegetarian dishes\nAug 2023 • Family\nComing to experience vegetarian cuisine here for the first time is truly an interesting thing and leaves a deep impression because when we enter, the first thing we will see is the quiet - fresh landscape of trees. Green, but also brings a very cozy feeling. The dishes are diverse, not only beautifully decorated but also very delicious. The staff here are very cheerful and considerate with diners, making me feel very satisfied and I will definitely become a loyal customer. set up with Zenhouse.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten November 17, 2023",
