            "review_text": "Tuan\n7 contributions\n4\nMake an appointment with Zenhouse in the nearest 1 day\nOct 2023 • Family\nI recently had the opportunity to enjoy dinner with my family at zenhouse, I must say it was a truly wonderful experience.\nThe dishes are diverse, not only creative but also rich in culinary flavors from Japan, Korea, Asia and Europe. As a vegetarian with my family since childhood, I feel happy to experience such diversity of plant cuisine.\nThe cozy and attractive garden space and light boat music make this the perfect destination for a delicious, fun meal with friends or relatives.\nThe restaurant has a chill garden view, is comfortable with cameras and has 2 cold rooms and a conference and banquet room for everyone.\n- The service staff is attentive and knowledgeable about the menu, and gives very enthusiastic advice.\n- This place often has cooking classes for families and music nights for blind people on the streets, sometimes contributing to the bustle in the heart of Saigon.\nI strongly recommend zenhouse to all my friends and everyone who is looking for a great culinary experience because zenhouse will not disappoint you. I will definitely come back soon to learn more about the classes and music nights and boat classes here.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten October 16, 2023",
